WEBVTT

00:03:58.744 --> 00:04:00.751
live in cities.

00:04:00.751 --> 00:04:04.723
In the developed world, it's about 78 percent.

00:04:04.723 --> 00:04:06.718
More than three out of four people

00:04:06.718 --> 00:04:10.758
live in urban institutions, urban places,

00:04:10.758 --> 00:04:12.366
in cities today.

00:04:12.366 --> 00:04:15.142
So cities are where the action is.

00:04:15.142 --> 00:04:18.258
Cities are us. Aristotle said in the ancient world,

00:04:18.258 --> 00:04:21.839
man is a political animal.

00:04:21.839 --> 00:04:24.866
I say we are an urban animal.

00:04:24.866 --> 00:04:29.731
We are an urban species, at home in our cities.

00:04:29.731 --> 00:04:31.883
So to come back to the dilemma,